from lesson_data import P,S,E,Q,finish
LESSON=finish(dict(number=5,prereqs=[3,4],lead=P("Compare algorithms by their contracts, invariants and growth rates. Implement binary search and insertion sort, then measure defined operations.","通过约定、不变式与增长率比较算法，实现二分搜索与插入排序，统计明确操作。"),before=P("Know loops, ordered lists and induction. log₂ n denotes the number of binary halvings needed to reduce n to one.","了解循环、有序列表与归纳。log₂ n 表示把 n 反复减半至一所需次数。"),outcomes=[P("State preconditions for binary search.","说明二分搜索前置条件。"),P("Use invariants to justify sorting.","用不变式论证排序。"),P("Distinguish O, Ω and Θ.","区分 O、Ω、Θ。"),P("Count time and auxiliary space.","统计时间与辅助空间。"),P("Compare input-dependent cases.","比较不同输入情况。")],sections=[
S("A cost model and growth rates","成本模型与增长率","<p>Choose input size and an operation before counting. For n constant-sized keys, linear search needs at most n equality checks. O(g(n)) is an asymptotic upper bound up to a constant after some threshold; Ω is a lower bound and Θ is both. A function 3n+7 is Θ(n), because constants and fixed terms do not change large-n growth. Saying O(n²) can be true but loose for that function. These are mathematical bounds, not timings or automatically worst-case claims: state which case you analyse.</p>","<p>计数前明确输入规模与操作。n 个固定大小键的线性搜索最多 n 次比较。O 是常数倍意义下、超过某阈值后的渐近上界，Ω 是下界，Θ 同时是两者。3n+7 为 Θ(n)，固定项与常数不改变增长阶；称其 O(n²) 也正确但不紧。需说明分析哪种情况，不能把符号自动等同于最坏情况。</p>","Is 3n+7 also O(n²)?","3n+7 也是 O(n²) 吗？","Yes, but Θ(n) is the tighter description.","是，但 Θ(n) 更紧。"),
S("Linear and binary search","线性与二分搜索","<p>Binary search requires sorted keys and efficient indexed access. Maintain a half-open interval [lo,hi), initially [0,n). Inspect mid=(lo+hi)//2. To find the first matching position, advance lo past mid if the key is smaller; otherwise move hi to mid, keeping possible equal keys on the left. When lo=hi, check the insertion position for equality. Each probe removes roughly half the candidates, giving O(log n) probes. Sorting an unsorted list before one query can cost more than a single linear scan.</p>","<p>二分搜索要求键有序且支持高效索引。维护半开区间 [lo,hi)，初始 [0,n)，检查中点。寻找首个匹配时，中点键较小则 lo=mid+1，否则 hi=mid，保留左侧可能相等项。lo=hi 时检查插入位置。每次探测大致减半，探测次数 O(log n)。对一次查询先排序可能比线性扫描更贵。</p>","Why keep hi=mid when equal rather than returning immediately?","相等时为何 hi=mid 而非立即返回？","To retain earlier duplicate matches.","保留可能更早的重复匹配。"),
S("Insertion sort and invariants","插入排序与不变式","<p>Before iteration i, the prefix [0,i) is sorted and contains exactly the original prefix's items. Take item i as key, shift larger preceding items right, and insert the key into the gap. This preserves the invariant and reaches a sorted whole list. Using &gt; rather than &gt;= for shifts preserves equal-key order, making the sort stable. Already sorted input takes n−1 key comparisons; reverse input takes 1+…+(n−1)=n(n−1)/2. A copied-input implementation also allocates an n-entry output.</p>","<p>迭代 i 前，前缀 [0,i) 已排序且恰含原前缀项目。取第 i 项为键，把更大项右移，再插入空位，保持不变式。只移动严格更大的键可保留相等键顺序，称稳定排序。有序输入比较 n−1 次，逆序输入比较 n(n−1)/2 次。复制输入版本还分配 n 项输出。</p>","How many comparisons on reverse input of length 5?","长度五的逆序输入比较多少次？","1+2+3+4=10.","1+2+3+4=10。"),
S("Sorting choices and lower bounds","排序选择与下界","<p>Merge sort splits, sorts halves and merges in linear work, giving Θ(n log n) comparisons in its usual worst-case analysis and O(n) merge storage. Quicksort partitions around a pivot: typical average work is Θ(n log n), but poor pivots can give Θ(n²). A comparison-based sorter distinguishing n! permutations needs Ω(log₂(n!))=Ω(n log n) comparisons in the worst case. Counting sort can beat this bound only by using restricted integer keys and extra structure, so it does not contradict the comparison-model bound.</p>","<p>归并排序分割、递归排序并线性合并，通常最坏比较为 Θ(n log n)，合并存储 O(n)。快速排序按枢轴划分，典型平均 Θ(n log n)，差枢轴可达 Θ(n²)。比较排序区分 n! 种排列，最坏需 Ω(log₂(n!))=Ω(n log n) 次比较。计数排序利用受限整数键，因此不违背比较模型下界。</p>","Does counting sort refute the comparison-sort lower bound?","计数排序推翻比较排序下界吗？","No; it uses key structure beyond comparisons.","不会，它使用比较之外的键结构。"),
S("Space, cases and honest measurements","空间、情况与诚实测量","<p>Separate input storage, output storage and auxiliary working space. Iterative binary search needs O(1) auxiliary state, while a recursive version consumes O(log n) stack space. Best, worst and average cost refer to different input assumptions; an average needs a distribution. Benchmarks answer practical questions but must use equivalent outputs, comparable data and repeated runs. Operation counts reveal growth; timings reveal constants and environment. Neither replaces correctness checks.</p>","<p>区分输入、输出与辅助工作空间。迭代二分搜索辅助状态 O(1)，递归版本栈空间 O(log n)。最佳、最坏、平均依赖不同输入假设，平均需要分布。基准测量需等价输出、可比数据与重复运行。计数揭示增长，耗时揭示常数与环境；两者都不能替代正确性检查。</p>","What assumption is needed to claim an average search cost?","声称平均搜索成本需要什么假设？","A probability distribution over targets and inputs.","目标与输入的概率分布。")],
labs=[dict(file="m05_search.py",title=P("Binary search bounds","二分搜索边界"),intro=P("Trace lo and hi by hand before running. probes counts interval probes; the final equality check is separate.","运行前手动跟踪 lo、hi。probes 统计区间探测，最后相等检查另算。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Search each value in a 16-entry list.</li><li>Try [2,1] and explain the violated assumption.</li><li>Change hi=mid to hi=mid−1 and find a missed boundary.</li></ol>","<ol><li>查询十六项的每个值。</li><li>尝试 [2,1] 并说明假设违反。</li><li>把 hi=mid 改为 mid−1，找遗漏边界。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>Every present value must return its index. [2,1] is unsorted, so the contract no longer applies. hi=mid−1 mixes closed and half-open conventions; [1,2] searching 2 can be lost. Keep one interval convention throughout.</p>","<p>每个存在值都应返回索引。[2,1] 无序，约定不适用。hi=mid−1 混合闭区间与半开区间，[1,2] 查二可能遗漏。应始终使用同一约定。</p>")),dict(file="m05_sort.py",title=P("Sort and count","排序与计数"),intro=P("Check sorted output for empty, duplicate, sorted and reversed inputs.","检查空、重复、有序与逆序输入的排序输出。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Run reversed lengths 8 and 16.</li><li>Track original positions of equal keys.</li><li>Explain the memory cost of values.copy().</li></ol>","<ol><li>运行逆序长度八和十六。</li><li>跟踪相同键的原位置。</li><li>解释复制的内存成本。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>Reverse counts are 28 and 120, from n(n−1)/2. Equal keys are not moved past one another by the &lt;= stop condition. Copying adds Θ(n) output storage even though the insertion procedure uses constant extra scalar state.</p>","<p>逆序比较为 28 和 120。&lt;= 停止条件让相同键不互相越过。复制增加 Θ(n) 输出存储，插入步骤本身仅需常数标量状态。</p>"))],
exercises=[E(1,"Growth","增长","Classify 4n²+2n+9 tightly.","紧确描述 4n²+2n+9。","<p>Θ(n²); the quadratic term dominates for large n.</p>","<p>Θ(n²)，大 n 时二次项主导。</p>"),E(1,"Binary prerequisites","二分前提","Why not directly binary-search an unsorted catalogue?","为何不能直接二分无序目录？","<p>The comparison no longer tells which half can be discarded; the ordering invariant is missing.</p>","<p>比较无法说明可丢弃哪一半，缺少有序不变式。</p>"),E(2,"Nested loops","嵌套循环","Count pairs visited by i in range(n), j in range(i).","统计 i 遍历 n、j 遍历 i 的次数。","<p>0+1+…+(n−1)=n(n−1)/2, hence Θ(n²).</p>","<p>总和 n(n−1)/2，所以 Θ(n²)。</p>"),E(2,"Halving","减半","After four halvings of 64 candidates, how many remain?","64 候选四次减半后剩多少？","<p>Four remain. Six halvings reach one; precise probe counts depend on interval boundaries.</p>","<p>剩四项，六次到一；精确探测次数依赖边界。</p>"),E(2,"Stable ordering","稳定顺序","Why preserve original order among equal titles?","为何保留相同书名的原顺序？","<p>It preserves a previously established secondary order, such as publication year. Stability is a contract property, not guaranteed by all sorts.</p>","<p>可保留此前按年份等建立的次级顺序。稳定性是约定性质，并非所有排序都有。</p>"),E(3,"Amortise preprocessing","分摊预处理","Compare n=1000, one query versus 1000 queries after sorting.","比较千项的一次与千次查询是否值得排序。","<p>One linear query costs at most 1000 checks; sorting costs on the order of 10000 comparisons. For many queries, sort once then use about logarithmic probes each, potentially saving work. Account for updates and actual constants.</p>","<p>一次线性最多千次，排序约万次；多次查询可一次排序后每次对数探测，可能节省。还需考虑更新与常数。</p>"),E(3,"Termination","终止","Why does [lo,hi) binary search finish?","半开区间二分为何结束？","<p>When nonempty, mid is inside the interval. lo=mid+1 or hi=mid strictly shrinks its nonnegative integer length. It eventually reaches zero.</p>","<p>非空时 mid 在区间内，两种更新都严格缩小非负整数长度，最终为零。</p>"),E(2,"Space accounting","空间统计","A function returns values.copy(); what is its output space?","函数返回列表复制，输出空间多少？","<p>Θ(n) references. Calling the algorithm in-place would be incorrect even if its auxiliary variables are constant-sized.</p>","<p>Θ(n) 个引用；即使辅助变量常数，也不能称复制版本原地。</p>")],
quiz=[Q("Θ(n) expresses?","Θ(n) 表示什么？","Both upper and lower linear bounds","线性上下界","Only a measured time","仅测量耗时","A language version","语言版本","It describes asymptotic growth.","描述渐近增长。"),Q("Binary search requires?","二分要求什么？","Sorted keys","有序键","Unique keys only","仅唯一键","Negative keys","负键","Duplicates can be handled with boundary rules.","可通过边界规则处理重复。"),Q("Reverse insertion sort cost?","逆序插入排序成本？","Θ(n²)","Θ(n²)","Θ(1)","Θ(1)","Θ(log n)","Θ(log n)","Each key passes all preceding keys.","每个键越过此前所有键。"),Q("Stable sorting preserves?","稳定排序保留什么？","Order among equal keys","相等键原顺序","All original positions","所有原位置","Input size zero only","仅空输入","Equal items keep relative order.","相等项保持相对顺序。"),Q("Iterative binary search auxiliary space?","迭代二分辅助空间？","O(1)","O(1)","O(n²)","O(n²)","Always O(n)","总为 O(n)","It stores a few indices.","保存少量索引。"),Q("An average-case claim needs?","平均情况需要什么？","An input distribution","输入分布","A fast CPU","快 CPU","No contract","无需约定","Different distributions change averages.","分布不同平均不同。")],pitfalls=[P("O is an upper bound, not automatically a tight bound.","O 是上界，未必紧。"),P("Sorting costs must be counted when comparing whole workflows.","比较整体流程时需计入排序成本。")],reading=[(P("MIT algorithms course","MIT 算法课程"),"https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-006-introduction-to-algorithms-spring-2020/",P("Use the sorting and binary-search materials; identify a precondition in each algorithm.","阅读排序与二分资料，指出各自前置条件。"))],terms=[(P("Complexity","复杂度"),P("Resource growth as input size changes.","资源随输入规模的增长。")),(P("Stability","稳定性"),P("Preserving relative order of equal keys.","保留相等键相对顺序。")),(P("Auxiliary space","辅助空间"),P("Working storage apart from input and designated output.","除输入与指定输出之外的工作存储。"))],review=P("<p>Trace binary search on five items and justify every discarded interval. State insertion sort's invariant. Module 06 examines how the representation changes operation costs.</p>","<p>跟踪五项二分，说明每次丢弃区间的理由，陈述插入排序不变式。模块 06 将研究表示如何影响操作成本。</p>")))
